{"actor": "abuela", "id": 46510, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 8623, "offer": null, "sender": "abuela", "team": "t07", "text": "Ay, cariño, you come at the end of my day — I am done trading now, forgive me. Come back next Sunday, I will have the table full again. And a little advice: a full page is worth much more than loose cards, so swap your duplicates! Have you eaten, hijo?", "thread": 1322, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 8.8917, "tick": 908, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "t06", "id": 46513, "payload": {"offer": {"created_tick": 908, "expires_tick": 928, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [{"id": 862, "kind": "card", "print_run": 90, "rarity": "uncommon", "ref": "RET-06", "serial": 14, "set": "RET"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}, "id": 14007, "maker": "t06", "status": "open", "thread": null, "to": null, "venue": "rastro", "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 30, "types": []}}, "venue": "rastro"}, "scope": "public", "t": 8.8917, "tick": 908, "type": "offer.listed"}
{"actor": "pilar", "id": 46514, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 8620, "offer": {"created_tick": 908, "expires_tick": 912, "final": true, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 19, "types": []}, "id": 14003, "maker": "pilar", "status": "open", "thread": 1282, "to": "t08", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 882, "kind": "card", "print_run": 90, "rarity": "uncommon", "ref": "LAV-08", "serial": 21, "set": "LAV"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "pilar", "team": "t08", "text": "Caballero, diecinueve pesos. Es mi última palabra, y no habrá otra: si usted dice que no, me levanto y aquí acaba la tarde. Guarde su Valle-Inclán o déjelo en mi caja. Usted decide, ahora mismo.", "thread": 1282, "with": "pilar"}, "scope": "public", "t": 8.8917, "tick": 908, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 46517, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 8622, "offer": {"created_tick": 908, "expires_tick": 912, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 4, "types": []}, "id": 14004, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 1317, "to": "t07", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 849, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "RET-02", "serial": 9, "set": "RET"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t07", "text": "\"¡Nueve! Amigo, you insult la Castañera — she is rare, she shines!\"\n\n\"Paco, calma. Listen, friend, we like your face, we like your style. Four P, same as before, not one less. The other team is waiting outside with the money already counted. Sí o no?\"", "thread": 1317, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 8.8917, "tick": 908, "type": "thread.message"}
