{"actor": "picaros", "id": 46547, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 8628, "offer": {"created_tick": 910, "expires_tick": 914, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 4, "types": []}, "id": 14018, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 1317, "to": "t07", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 849, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "RET-02", "serial": 9, "set": "RET"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t07", "text": "\"¡Siete! Paco, cover your ears — ¡Qué dolor!\"\n\n\"Amigo, listen fast: they stopped printing la Castañera yesterday. Finished, no more, ever. After today she only goes up, and you stand here counting slow.\"\n\n\"Four P. Same as always, not one less. Sí o no, guapo?\"", "thread": 1317, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 8.9083, "tick": 910, "type": "thread.message"}
